														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4853603">
									

<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: Tale</p>
<p>Pitch:<br />
<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4666">SCP-4666</a> is a terrifying entity force, and essentially unstoppable. The entry log is scary, but how horrifying would it be to be a part of one of the entities hunts?</p>
<p>Central Narrative: The story follows a little boy and his family who live in rural Germany, the story starting off at night with the little boy shouting for his mother &quot;Mommy, mommy! There's a man outside!&quot; the family then doesn't see the man and the story would progress through the different stages of the hunt all the way until the end in which 4666 kills the family and kidnaps the boy the end of the story would then switch perspectives to a boy in rural Ireland who is shouting, &quot;Mommy, mommy! There's a man outside!&quot;</p>
<p>Attention Grabber: Christmas isn't the time for laughter and cheer anymore</p>
<p>Additional Notes: I actually told a story similar to this as a camp fire story, thought it would be interesting as a tale, feedback of any kind is appreciated :) Hope you enjoyed, and hope you're having a Merry Christmas</p>

